---
// 글로벌 푸터 — ★다크 배경 + 영문 내비(GNB와 동일). 브랜드·면책.
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
const links = [
  { href: '/about/', label: 'About' },
  { href: '/ministry/', label: 'Ministry' },
  { href: '/education/', label: 'Education' },
  { href: '/ai-trend/', label: 'AI Trend' },
  { href: '/insight/', label: 'Insight' },
  { href: '/privacy/', label: '개인정보처리방침' },
];
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container foot">
    <div class="foot-brand">
      <span class="brand-mark">Kyle Choi</span>
      <p>AI를 일과 삶에 적용하는 법 — 목회·교육·AI트렌드·시대분석.</p>
    </div>
    <nav class="foot-nav" aria-label="푸터 메뉴">
      {links.map((l) => <a href={l.href}>{l.label}</a>)}
    </nav>
  </div>
  <div class="container foot-base">
    <p>© {year} Kyle Choi · DiA Ai Edu. Solution. AI 멀티에이전트 시스템이 검증을 거쳐 생산한 콘텐츠입니다.</p>
    <p class="disclaimer">※ 시대분석 등 콘텐츠는 정보 제공 목적이며 투자 자문이 아닙니다.</p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer { margin-top: var(--space-section); background: var(--foot-bg); color: var(--foot-ink); }
  .foot { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 2rem; justify-content: space-between; padding-block: var(--space-block); }
  .foot-brand { max-width: 40ch; }
  .foot-brand .brand-mark { font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.15rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #fff; }
  .foot-brand p { margin-top: 0.6rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--foot-muted); line-height: 1.6; }
  .foot-nav { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.4rem; align-content: start; }
  .foot-nav a { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--foot-muted); letter-spacing: 0.01em; transition: color var(--dur) var(--ease); }
  .foot-nav a:hover { color: #fff; }
  .foot-base { padding-bottom: var(--space-block); border-top: 1px solid var(--foot-line); padding-top: 1.4rem; }
  .foot-base p { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--foot-muted); }
  .foot-base .disclaimer { margin-top: 0.3rem; opacity: 0.85; }
</style>
